# Copy to .env (or .env.local) and adjust. Vite only exposes VITE_-prefixed variables to the app.

# "true" runs the in-browser mock benchmark instead of calling the FastAPI backend.
VITE_USE_MOCK=false

# Origin of the FastAPI backend, e.g. http://127.0.0.1:8000. Leave empty to call the
# same origin the app is served from (during `vite` dev the /api path is proxied).
VITE_API_BASE=

# Dev-server proxy target. vite.config.ts reads VITE_API_TARGET from the shell
# environment (not from this file) when it sets up the /api proxy; it defaults to
# http://127.0.0.1:8000. Example: VITE_API_TARGET=http://localhost:9000 pnpm dev
# VITE_API_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000
